/**
 * DRIVE MAD — Levels & Config
 * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 * HOW TO EDIT LEVELS:
 *   Each level has: name, theme, spawnX, spawnY, finishX,
 *                   segments[], obstacles[]
 *
 * SEGMENT TYPES:
 *   flat    { x, y, w }                  Flat road section
 *   ramp    { x, y, w, rise }            Slope (rise>0 up, rise<0 down)
 *   gap     { x, w }                     Empty void
 *   bridge  { x, y, w, sag }             Bendy bridge planks
 *   bump    { x, y, w, h }               Speed bump
 *   see-saw { x, y, w }                  Balancing plank
 *   box     { x, y, w, h, color }        Static box obstacle
 *   moving  { x, y, w, range, speed }    Left-right sliding platform
 *
 * OBSTACLE TYPES (in obstacles[]):
 *   spinner { x, y, r, speed }           Spinning log above track
 *
 * THEMES: sky | sunset | forest | desert | night | storm | candy | space
 */

